<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13254" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dē-prŏpĕro</span></b> ,
			āre, v. n. and <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>a.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Neutr., to make great haste, to hasten</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cito introite, et cito deproperate,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Cas. 3, 6, 17</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Act., to hasten</i> or <i>accelerate
				greatly, to prepare hastily</i> (very rare): coronas, *
				<i><span class="en">Hor.
				Od. 2, 7, 24</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">miserabile humandi munus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					2, 265</span></i>
			.—With <i>inf.</i> as object: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sacruficare,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Poen. 1, 2, 108</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
